If {MD_STAGED_OFFERING_PORTFOLIO_FILE} is not empty:
    For {MD_STAGED_OFFERING_PORTFOLIO_FILE}:
        Rotate the picture 90° counterclockwise before OCR and before applying any read-area instructions.
    {MD_STAGED_OFFERING_PORTFOLIO_READ_AREA_01} = All post-its sticking in following rectangle area: x between 0% and 33%, y between 0% and 100%
    {MD_STAGED_OFFERING_PORTFOLIO_READ_AREA_02} = All post-its sticking in following rectangle area: x between 33% and 66%, y between 0% and 100%
    {MD_STAGED_OFFERING_PORTFOLIO_READ_AREA_03} = All post-its sticking in following rectangle area: x between 66% and 100%, y between 0% and 100%

